# More gas, more pressure
register lv2
seal v1 500mL
add v1 N2 0.001mol
measure v1 pressure
new
seal v2 500mL
add v2 N2 0.002mol
measure v2 pressure
new
seal v3 500mL
add v3 N2 0.004mol
measure v3 pressure
new
seal v4 500mL
add v4 N2 0.008mol
measure v4 pressure
# Ideal rigid headspaces only; leakage and gauge uncertainty are omitted.
